{"351100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Niffelheim", "steam_appid": 351100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [875620, 735433, 875621], "detailed_description": "<h1>Games created by the artist Eduard Arutyunyan</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive in the Underworld</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351100/extras/c88556fbf0c30cc0fd1a39d333b3fa15.poster.avif?t=1745494549\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351100/extras/c88556fbf0c30cc0fd1a39d333b3fa15.webm?t=1745494549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351100/extras/c88556fbf0c30cc0fd1a39d333b3fa15.mp4?t=1745494549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Warriors remain warriors even after death. Set out on the path to the last challenge and prove yourself to the Gods. In life you were never frightened by the cold, darkness and death, and you won't fear now. make sure you have enough provision, defend yourself and unravel the mysteries of these lands.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do not be forgotten</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351100/extras/a783ab2a3418c19c086e26e0417ca80c.webp?t=1745494549\" width=364 height=13 /></span><br>Crush anyone who dares to attack your lands. Each fallen enemy brings you closer to Asgard! Bones, teeth, fur - use all that you scavenge to craft weapons and armor. Build a fortress that will protect you from enemies and help you to destroy the attackers. The Death Priests will issue ultimatums. Will you bend to their will, or reject their orders and accept the battle against their dead minions?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find a way out</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351100/extras/a783ab2a3418c19c086e26e0417ca80c.webp?t=1745494549\" width=364 height=13 /></span><br>Collect all the pieces of the portal to Asgard. But be careful - they are fiercely guarded by mighty giants, deadly spiders and hordes of undead.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351100/extras/a783ab2a3418c19c086e26e0417ca80c.webp?t=1745494549\" width=364 height=13 /></span><br>Brew potions from mushrooms and slain beasts to become stronger. Cook the best dishes to feed all your friends. Prepare poison that will kill the most powerful troll.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore ancient caves</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351100/extras/a783ab2a3418c19c086e26e0417ca80c.webp?t=1745494549\" width=364 height=13 /></span><br>Reach the very heart of the world to find powerful artefacts that will help you win the final battle. Discover what lies hidden in the darkness.", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive in the Underworld</h2> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351100/extras/c88556fbf0c30cc0fd1a39d333b3fa15.poster.avif?t=1745494549\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351100/extras/c88556fbf0c30cc0fd1a39d333b3fa15.webm?t=1745494549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351100/extras/c88556fbf0c30cc0fd1a39d333b3fa15.mp4?t=1745494549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Warriors remain warriors even after death. Set out on the path to the last challenge and prove yourself to the Gods. In life you were never frightened by the cold, darkness and death, and you won't fear now. make sure you have enough provision, defend yourself and unravel the mysteries of these lands.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do not be forgotten</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351100/extras/a783ab2a3418c19c086e26e0417ca80c.webp?t=1745494549\" width=364 height=13 /></span><br>Crush anyone who dares to attack your lands. Each fallen enemy brings you closer to Asgard! Bones, teeth, fur - use all that you scavenge to craft weapons and armor. Build a fortress that will protect you from enemies and help you to destroy the attackers. The Death Priests will issue ultimatums. Will you bend to their will, or reject their orders and accept the battle against their dead minions?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find a way out</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351100/extras/a783ab2a3418c19c086e26e0417ca80c.webp?t=1745494549\" width=364 height=13 /></span><br>Collect all the pieces of the portal to Asgard. But be careful - they are fiercely guarded by mighty giants, deadly spiders and hordes of undead.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351100/extras/a783ab2a3418c19c086e26e0417ca80c.webp?t=1745494549\" width=364 height=13 /></span><br>Brew potions from mushrooms and slain beasts to become stronger. Cook the best dishes to feed all your friends. Prepare poison that will kill the most powerful troll.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore ancient caves</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351100/extras/a783ab2a3418c19c086e26e0417ca80c.webp?t=1745494549\" width=364 height=13 /></span><br>Reach the very heart of the world to find powerful artefacts that will help you win the final battle. Discover what lies hidden in the darkness.", "short_description": "Your avatar is a brave warrior who has fallen in battle. But instead of well-deserved peace in Asgard, his soul is trapped in the harsh world of Niffelheim. Survive in this hostile world, ransack the neighbor lands, explore dangerous dungeons and find your way to Valhalla", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Italian, Korean, Turkish, Hungarian, Traditional Chinese", "reviews": "“Niffelheim is a deep, complex survival dungeon crawler with a wonderful style that offers a ton of longevity in its gameplay, as long as you’re okay restarting multiple times.”<br>8.5/10 – Critical Hit<br><br>“Despite its issues, Niffelheim stands as a very competent hardcore survival game that players will be engaged with for hours on end.”<br>80/100 – Windows Central<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351100/header.jpg?t=1745494549", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351100/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745494549", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/351100/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745494549", "website": "http://www.niffelheim.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 and newest<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.7 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris 4800<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 4:3 and 21:9 screen ratio supported</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 7, 8, 10<br></li>